{"id":"xudat","qid":"Q2996307","category":"city","type":"oikonym","names":{"az":"Xudat","ru":"Худат","en":"Xudat"},"coordinates":[48.67722,41.63389],"coordinatesSource":"wd","region":"quba-xacmaz","regionSource":"wp-az-regions","admin":[{"qid":"Q6398826","az":"Xaçmaz rayonu","en":"Khachmaz District"}],"firstRecord":null,"period":null,"forms":[],"namedAfter":[],"etymology":[],"summary":{"az":{"text":"Xudat — Azərbaycan Respublikasının Xaçmaz rayonunun Xudat şəhər inzibati ərazi dairəsində şəhər. 1950-ci ildə rayon tabeli şəhər statusu almışdır. Xudat 1943-cü ildə yaradılmış Xudat inzibati rayonunun mərkəzi olmuşdur. Bu rayon 1959-cu ildə ləğv edillmiş və Xudat daha əvvəllər aid olduğu Xaçmaz rayonunun inzibati idarəsinə verilmişdir. Belə ki, rayonun Xudat şəhəri, Müqtədir qəsəbəsi, Nabran, Yalama, Qusarçay, Ləcət və Susayqışlaq kənd sovetləri Xaçmaza, Şirvanovka kənd sovetliyi isə Qusar rayonuna verilmişdir.","truncated":true,"source":"wp-az"},"ru":{"text":"Худат (азерб. Xudat, лезг. Худат) — город в Хачмазском районе Азербайджана, на севере страны, близ побережья Каспийского моря, в 184 км от Баку. Расположен в Самур-Дивичинской низменности.","truncated":false,"source":"wp-ru"},"en":{"text":"Khudat (also Xtar; Azerbaijani: Xudat Azerbaijani pronunciation: [xuˈdat], Lezgian: ХтIар Lezgian pronunciation: [ˈχtʼar]) is a town in the Caspian lowlands located in the northern section of Azerbaijan. It is a part of the Khachmaz District. It has a population of 14,442. \nKhudat's time of historical significance took place in the 18th century, as the provincial capital of the Quba khanate under the rule of the Qajars.","truncated":true,"source":"wp-en"}},"images":[{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/53/Houses_in_Khudat.jpg/960px-Houses_in_Khudat.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","small":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/53/Houses_in_Khudat.jpg/960px-Houses_in_Khudat.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","width":800,"height":530,"page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Houses_in_Khudat.jpg","title":"Houses in Khudat.jpg","artist":"Interfase","credit":"Own work","license":"Public domain","licenseUrl":null,"source":"img-1"}],"sources":[{"id":"wd","kind":"wikidata","title":"Wikidata Q2996307: Xudat","publisher":"Wikidata","url":"https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q2996307","licence":"CC0 1.0","retrieved":"2026-11-26"},{"id":"wp-az","kind":"wikipedia","lang":"az","title":"Xudat","publisher":"Vikipediya (azərbaycanca)","url":"https://az.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=Xudat&oldid=9049851","pageUrl":"https://az.wikipedia.org/wiki/Xudat","revid":9049851,"revDate":"2026-08-25","licence":"CC BY-SA 4.0","retrieved":"2026-11-26"},{"id":"wp-ru","kind":"wikipedia","lang":"ru","title":"Худат","publisher":"Википедия (на русском)","url":"https://ru.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%D0%A5%D1%83%D0%B4%D0%B0%D1%82&oldid=142466355","pageUrl":"https://ru.wikipedia.org/wiki/%D0%A5%D1%83%D0%B4%D0%B0%D1%82","revid":142466355,"revDate":"2025-01-03","licence":"CC BY-SA 4.0","retrieved":"2026-11-26"},{"id":"wp-en","kind":"wikipedia","lang":"en","title":"Khudat","publisher":"Wikipedia (English)","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=Khudat&oldid=1387168965","pageUrl":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Khudat","revid":1387168965,"revDate":"2026-11-22","licence":"CC BY-SA 4.0","retrieved":"2026-11-26"},{"id":"wp-az-regions","kind":"wikipedia","lang":"az","title":"Azərbaycanın iqtisadi rayonları","publisher":"Vikipediya (azərbaycanca)","url":"https://az.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=Az%C9%99rbaycan%C4%B1n_iqtisadi_rayonlar%C4%B1&oldid=9209860","pageUrl":"https://az.wikipedia.org/wiki/Az%C9%99rbaycan%C4%B1n_iqtisadi_rayonlar%C4%B1","revid":9209860,"revDate":"2026-11-19","licence":"CC BY-SA 4.0","retrieved":"2026-11-26"},{"id":"img-1","kind":"commons","title":"File:Houses in Khudat.jpg","publisher":"Wikimedia Commons","url":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Houses_in_Khudat.jpg","licence":"Public domain","retrieved":"2026-11-26"}],"langs":["az","ru","en"],"verification":"review"}